Comment: 0,0:12:15.65,0:12:21.78,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:28.79,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.64,0:01:34.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}12 Rick Doms from Admiral Dozle's\Nforces were eradicated...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.45,0:01:38.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...thanks to the teamwork of the\NWhite Base crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.00,0:01:41.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, their ship had to return\Nto Side 6 without being repaired...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.75,0:01:46.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...at the floating dock\Noutside the Side's airspace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.09,0:01:50.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For the White Base,\Nthere was no safe haven.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.69,0:02:05.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome back. How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.82,0:02:08.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More formalities about our stay.\NThey want us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.48,0:02:11.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... the Tianem Fleet\Nhasn't given us movement orders yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.87,0:02:14.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...and the enemy could be lying in wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.21,0:02:16.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When do you expect Amuro back?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.59,0:02:18.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In 2 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.04,0:02:18.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something important?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.95,0:02:21.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes... I'm quite sure it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.46,0:02:25.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's finish maintenance in three hours.\NWe're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.22,0:02:42.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man! They could have at least\Ngiven me a weather schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.84,0:03:11.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.49,0:03:28.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poor thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.77,0:04:08.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.20,0:04:11.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean...\NI didn't mean to scare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.82,0:04:21.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh... about that bird...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.91,0:04:26.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Were you fond of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:30.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who could hate beautiful things?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.63,0:04:33.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who could hate beautiful things?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.34,0:04:36.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who could hate beautiful things?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:39.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...beautiful things?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.28,0:04:44.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you think there is anyone\Nwho hates beautiful things?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.60,0:04:48.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it sad to watch them\Ngrow old and perish?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.19,0:04:53.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Sure it is...\NBut what I wanted to ask was...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.56,0:04:55.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look! It's stopped raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.80,0:05:00.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your eyes are so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.70,0:05:02.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.17,0:05:40.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure we should leave\NConscon's group?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.34,0:05:41.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.99,0:05:45.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Dozle and Conscon only\Nhave their eyes on the immediate enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.99,0:05:48.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not the case with Lady Kycilia.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.37,0:05:51.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's looking at the direction\Nof the overall war.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.37,0:05:54.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exactly what is at Side 6, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.71,0:05:59.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll be entering battle soon.\NYou'll find out then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.36,0:06:00.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's enter the port.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.12,0:06:12.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain Char's Zanzibar\Nis docking at Side 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.85,0:06:14.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char is...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.65,0:06:16.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Always doing whatever he pleases.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.37,0:06:35.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now there's a big surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.74,0:06:38.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're docked in the same port\Nas an enemy warship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.70,0:06:41.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a scene that could only happen\Nin a neutral Side.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.37,0:06:43.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's like a comic book!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.12,0:06:47.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't we invite the enemy over\Nand throw a party or something. Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.47,0:06:48.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.27,0:06:57.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just can't forgive them...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.44,0:06:58.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.80,0:07:02.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "where"?\NMr. Ryu's killers are right in front of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.19,0:07:04.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.02,0:07:08.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know what consequences we'd face\Nif we fought at this Side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.78,0:07:09.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But still...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.90,0:07:13.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll be departing very soon.\NNo one is to leave the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.70,0:07:18.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of maintenance to do still.\NEveryone, to your stations now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.42,0:07:20.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.46,0:07:24.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just be sure you don't prolong\Nthe duration of your stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.42,0:07:25.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.34,0:07:27.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, the weapon seals...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.39,0:07:28.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm aware of the penalties.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.98,0:07:32.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine. And I don't want any trouble\Nwith the Federation Forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.43,0:07:34.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've already informed my men.\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.14,0:07:49.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that so? I'm so happy\Nyou've become the Gundam pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.05,0:07:51.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The part I gave you last night!\NHow was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.28,0:07:52.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.71,0:07:53.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.05,0:07:57.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The new device I handed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.02,0:08:00.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It had tremendous effects... didn't it?\NAmuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.37,0:08:02.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh. Yeah.\NOf... course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.23,0:08:05.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, it worked great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:09.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll develop more. And more!\NI'll concentrate on new upgrades!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.55,0:08:13.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.51,0:08:15.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It worked, did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.93,0:08:19.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course it did,\NI made it after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.10,0:08:20.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My next one will be even...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.20,0:08:35.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.06,0:09:00.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HDEE47B&\1a&H49&\3c&H40461D&\3a&H42&}What good are shelter capsules, anyway?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.74,0:09:04.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HDEE47B&\1a&H49&\3c&H40461D&\3a&H42&}Dad, are mobile suits more important{\i}\N{\i1}to you than human beings?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.36,0:09:05.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HDEE47B&\1a&H49&\3c&H40461D&\3a&H42&}Send out the trailer!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.15,0:09:06.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HDEE47B&\1a&H49&\3c&H40461D&\3a&H42&}Dad!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.61,0:09:08.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HDEE47B&\1a&H49&\3c&H40461D&\3a&H42&}You go to the White Base, too!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.67,0:09:09.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HDEE47B&\1a&H49&\3c&H40461D&\3a&H42&}Dad...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.16,0:09:11.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.29,0:09:17.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh no...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.83,0:09:18.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.63,0:09:30.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have taken the shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.23,0:09:42.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:02.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Char?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.50,0:10:06.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that. Unfortunately,\Nthe driver's still a novice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.63,0:10:08.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.31,0:10:15.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that. I thought\Nyou'd be able to dodge it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.14,0:10:19.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll have to tow your car out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.56,0:10:20.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.23,0:10:23.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you are...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.61,0:10:25.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro. I'm Amuro Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.73,0:10:27.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.59,0:10:30.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's strange... I feel as though\NI've heard your name before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.94,0:10:34.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, I know you.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.16,0:10:36.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know who you are.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.26,0:10:51.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.10,0:10:52.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Relax. I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.67,0:10:54.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Oh, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.91,0:10:56.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.01,0:10:59.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char Aznable. I'm a soldier, as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.18,0:11:01.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Char!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.97,0:11:05.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lalah! Step on the gas! But gently!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.38,0:11:07.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.27,0:11:11.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So this is Char.{\i}\N{\i1}Char Aznable, he said.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.61,0:11:14.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take it easy. Got it, Lalah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.28,0:11:19.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?\NStand back, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.13,0:11:23.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've never met him before.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.57,0:11:26.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So how did I know that he was Char?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.11,0:11:29.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And that girl...he called her Lalah.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.93,0:11:41.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.26,0:11:43.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me? I'm 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.02,0:11:45.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that so? You're still young.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.09,0:11:49.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can understand why you'd be nervous\Nin front of an enemy soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.10,0:11:52.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it would be nice if you\Nat least said thanks, Amuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.19,0:11:56.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh. Of course. Thank you very much.\NI'd better go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.05,0:12:05.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that boy so nervous about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.79,0:12:08.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He probably recognized your name, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.27,0:12:10.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char, the Red Comet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.21,0:12:13.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He must have been afraid of you... I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.41,0:12:33.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The situation hasn't changed at all\Nsince we arrived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.07,0:12:35.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No sense in worrying about it, Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.94,0:12:39.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right. We send the Gundam out in front...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.03,0:12:40.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.30,0:12:43.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh. We've been waiting for you.\NYou wanted something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.66,0:12:47.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Actually... I was hoping\NI could help you out personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.34,0:12:49.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cameron...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.37,0:12:50.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.83,0:12:53.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have a private ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:55.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can use it to escort you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.92,0:12:59.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If a Side 6 ship were shielding you,\Nthe Zeons couldn't open fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:01.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I do appreciate the thought, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.93,0:13:04.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cameron. What do you expect\Nby doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.43,0:13:09.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm shocked to hear you asking\Nsuch a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.15,0:13:11.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd rather you didn't interfere\Nin our business.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.33,0:13:13.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-Mirai!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.03,0:13:17.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you won't get off this ship,\Nthen at least accept my help...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.38,0:13:20.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If that's not interfering,\NI don't know what is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.61,0:13:23.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no need to be insulting!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.28,0:13:27.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're just trying to convince me\Nthat you can be helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.60,0:13:33.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,B-But you weren't there when I was\Nsuffering the most. It's too late now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.33,0:13:35.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But now I'm able to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.42,0:13:37.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.65,0:13:38.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.05,0:13:42.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.18,0:13:43.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.14,0:13:45.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This man is serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.14,0:13:46.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Understand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.35,0:13:48.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why he's offering to take this risk!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.43,0:13:51.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This may be a neutral Side...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.43,0:13:54.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...but one stray missile, and he's dead!\NYou understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.98,0:13:55.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.55,0:13:59.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can you stand there quietly\Nwhile she's hassling you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.78,0:14:01.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no need to hit her. If we talked...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.55,0:14:03.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're serious, you'd have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.32,0:14:05.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's so barbaric.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.78,0:14:09.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right, Mr. Cameron.\NIt's all about determination.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.75,0:14:11.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, Ensign?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.12,0:14:13.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Sleggar...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.33,0:14:16.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you haven't changed your mind...\NI would like to accept your offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.17,0:14:19.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right. Please let me do this... Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.86,0:14:40.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.94,0:14:43.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But a Side 6 civilian ship is next to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.95,0:14:46.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It takes all kinds, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.73,0:14:49.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Have the Rick Doms launched?\N- They should be ready now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.34,0:15:02.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Trojan Horse has changed course.\NIt's escaping in the opposite direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.30,0:15:04.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deploy the Rick Doms at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.81,0:15:06.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never mind airspace violations!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.79,0:15:10.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It will be fine!\NThe fighting will be outside the borders!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.09,0:15:13.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't stand being laughed at\Nby an upstart like Char.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.65,0:15:29.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This wasn't part of our deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.73,0:15:31.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll have to compensate me very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.45,0:15:33.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.53,0:15:40.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-Mr. Cameron. We're already at the edge\Nof our airspace. If we go further...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.58,0:15:41.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.46,0:15:45.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa! They're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.13,0:15:46.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.46,0:15:49.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bright! There are Zeon mobile suits!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.01,0:15:50.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.10,0:15:52.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've done enough, Mr. Cameron.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.10,0:15:56.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No. Not until you leave our airspace...{\i}\N{\i1}in fact, we'll stay as long as we can fly.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.80,0:15:58.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did something happen up on the bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.65,0:16:00.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no concern for a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.31,0:16:01.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be at the main cannons.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.98,0:16:02.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.32,0:16:07.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Approaching Side 6 perimeter!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.33,0:16:14.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mr. Cameron.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.29,0:16:15.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.29,0:16:18.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please pull back.{\i}\N{\i1}We have no choice but to fight them.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.92,0:16:23.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Cameron... Thank you.{\i}\N{\i1}I'm grateful for your feelings.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.71,0:16:26.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However...!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.51,0:16:29.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Cameron, thank you.{\i}\N{\i1}Please go home...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.06,0:16:31.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Give my best to your father and mother.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.76,0:16:34.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-Mirai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.39,0:16:35.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.77,0:16:36.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.39,0:16:41.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please! Fly by the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.13,0:16:48.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Open hatch!\NPrepare to deploy the Gundam!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.20,0:16:50.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Guncannon and G-Fighter!\NStand by!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.61,0:17:04.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.72,0:17:12.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,White Base, go to full combat speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.05,0:17:13.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Engaging in anti-air combat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.97,0:17:14.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.13,0:17:24.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! Rick Doms,\Ncommence the attack now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.98,0:17:38.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mega beam cannons, hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.39,0:17:40.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, stray beams might\Nenter Side 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.02,0:17:43.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's started!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.04,0:17:47.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The battle's... started...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.09,0:17:49.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A TV crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.13,0:17:50.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-Mirai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.06,0:18:01.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,J-Jamice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.43,0:18:09.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think you're so hot...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.15,0:18:11.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, Kai! Ignore the mobile suits!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.82,0:18:14.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All the main cannons need to do\Nis keep the enemy ship at bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.08,0:18:18.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hit the enemy ships from the side!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.70,0:18:20.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Until then, use only\Nthe missiles for defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.66,0:18:21.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.00,0:18:27.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Impossible!\NIt just can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.05,0:18:34.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's almost like he's predicting our moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.09,0:18:36.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! It's just a fluke! Just luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.58,0:18:39.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our only hope is to confuse him!\NLet's use our favorite tactic!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.64,0:18:40.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.47,0:19:15.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can see... how they'll move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.69,0:19:19.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.39,0:19:22.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is not a TV drama.{\i}\N{\i1}This is actual combat.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.43,0:19:25.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Federation and Zeon{\i}\N{\i1}are currently battling in outer space.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.74,0:19:27.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in the White Base!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.85,0:19:30.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Show me the Gundam!\NShow me how it's doing in battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.74,0:19:32.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right. There!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.33,0:19:35.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, Amuro!\NWhat are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.52,0:19:38.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant! Enemy ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.37,0:19:40.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know. Now just watch...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.71,0:19:49.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I repeat. This is a real battle.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.24,0:19:52.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1\an8}The fighting is going on{\i}\N{\i1}just outside Side 6 borders.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.62,0:19:54.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1\an8}The Federation's White Base{\i}\N{\i1}is fighting alone...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.94,0:19:57.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1\an8}...against 3 Zeon ships.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.94,0:19:57.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Has Flanagan been treating you well?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.22,0:19:57.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.22,0:20:01.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Watch this very carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.23,0:20:04.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Real combat isn't nearly as\Nattractive as a TV drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.86,0:20:06.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As witnesses to this conflict...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.73,0:20:10.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...we must all give thought to the position{\i}\N{\i1}our nation should take in the future.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.90,0:20:12.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.24,0:20:22.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He fell for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.09,0:20:28.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait a second! I...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.56,0:20:38.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.40,0:20:40.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro's intuition is especially keen today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.18,0:20:44.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm running out of energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.26,0:20:47.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I can't use the beam rifle\NI've got to switch to close combat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.96,0:20:57.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.86,0:21:00.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can just one ship cause us\Nthis much trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.66,0:21:03.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char is watching us! Char!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.32,0:21:08.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ram into them!! Ram the Chivvay\Nright into the side of that Trojan Horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.69,0:21:21.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Musais have been destroyed, and{\i}\N{\i1}the Chivvay heavy cruiser is advancing.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.34,0:21:24.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As there are no mobile suits in sight,{\i}\N{\i1}this battle is unpredictable.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.91,0:21:27.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The white mobile suit is going to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.06,0:21:30.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm? But the Gundam's not even on screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.48,0:21:31.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.79,0:21:35.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why you took a woman like me\Nunder your wing, isn't it, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.30,0:21:38.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're perceptive, Lalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.86,0:21:46.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're ramming us.{\i}\N{\i1}It's proof that they're getting desperate.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.16,0:21:47.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where's their vital spot?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.29,0:21:50.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.55,0:21:53.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enemy below!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.50,0:21:54.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.51,0:22:00.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! Portside!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.47,0:22:01.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Left?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.54,0:22:15.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.73,0:22:19.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right!\NWay to go, Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.19,0:22:23.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to my new device!\NThe Gundam's the real deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.85,0:22:31.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hooray for the Earth Federation!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.44,0:22:37.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can head back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.44,0:22:37.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.05,0:22:45.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please make it through this...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.03,0:23:02.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Side... 6...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.25,0:23:22.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Earth Federation Forces stage\Na full-scale attack...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.76,0:23:24.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...against Space Fortress Solomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.51,0:23:28.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At the vanguard of the Tianem Fleet,\Nthe White Base cuts through the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.56,0:23:33.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For the first time, Amuro and the crew\Nrisk their lives in the middle of a battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.10,0:23:37.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...\NThe Glory of Solomon
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.40,0:23:41.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be able to survive?
